				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισχεσία</span>
			, <i>excuse, pretext</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δ᾽
				ἔφεξιν;</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίνος χάριν</span>
			; <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				338
			</span></i> (troch.), cf. <i><span class="en">
