				<u>Fr.</u>
				599
			</span></i> (tragic use, acc. to Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> l.c.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>checking, stopping,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(9).207.10
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Eretria</span>).</div>
